    <footnotes>
        <footnote id="F1">The Reporting Owner entered into an exchange transaction with the Issuer  pursuant to an agreement dated November 13, 2026 whereby (i) $4.0 million of outstanding principal and accrued interest owed to the Reporting Owner was exchanged for 4,000 shares of the Issuer's Series C Convertible Preferred Stock (&quot;Series C Preferred&quot;); (iii) 8,900,406 shares of the Issuer's common stock held by the Reporting Owner was exchanged for 3,360 shares of Series C Preferred;  (iv) the Issuer issued the Company a warrant to purchase an aggregate of 9,684,211 shares of common stock (the &quot;Warrant&quot;). The transaction was approved by the Board of Directors of each of the Reporting Owner and the Issuer and is exempt pursuant to Rules 16b-3 (d) and (e) of the Securities Exchange Act of 1934, as amended.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F2">The Series C Preferred is exercisable immediately and does not expire.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F3">The Series C Preferred and Warrants are subject to beneficial ownership limitations whereby they shall not be exercisable, and the Series C Preferred cannot be converted, to the extent their exercise or conversion, as the case may be, would cause the beneficial ownership of Common Stock held by the Reporting Owner to exceed 50% of the total issued and outstanding shares of Common Stock of the Issuer (&quot;Beneficial Ownership Limitation&quot;), which Beneficial Ownership Limitation expires on December 23, 2027.</footnote>
